Package: cgjrdata
Title: Data Preparation for the Country Jobs and Growth Report
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ifeanyi", "Edochie", email = "iedochie@worldbank.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Pulls, processes and packages the 135 indicators that make up the
    World Bank Country Jobs and Growth Report (CGJR) analytical framework.
    Provides four lazyloaded objects for use by the cgjrapp Shiny dashboard including,
    rawdata_list (raw source panels), ctfdata_list (Closeness-to-Frontier
    dynamic scores with subcluster score columns), metadata_tbl (variable
    catalogue), and institutional_averages_tbl (subcluster, cluster and
    overall aggregated scores).
